msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key used to encrypt stored API tokens. It must be readable by the web server and poller users and not world-readable. When the file is missing, only token files can be used."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke gaa na igodo 32-byte e ji ezo token API e chekwara echekwa n'ụzọ nzuzo. Ndị ọrụ sava weebụ na poller ga-enwerịrị ike ịgụ ya, ma ọ gaghị abụ ihe onye ọ bụla nwere ike ịgụ. Mgbe faịlụ ahụ na-adịghị, naanị faịlụ token ka a pụrụ iji."

