msgstr "Nduzi Faịlụ Token"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Absolute path of the directory that every account token file must be in. When empty, a token file may be anywhere the web server and poller users can read."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke nke nduzi nke faịlụ token akaụntụ ọ bụla ga-anọ n'ime ya. Mgbe ọ tọgbọrọ chakoo, faịlụ token nwere ike ịnọ ebe ọ bụla ndị ọrụ sava weebụ na poller pụrụ ịgụ."

